DESCRIPTION:Perreo baby\, Tratra baby. ¿Dónde están lxs nenxs que quier
 en perreooooo? 🔥💃🏽 Toronto\, aquí se baila. 🇨🇦💫 Las Mal
 inches is back\, hotter than ever\, with a second edition\, but mejor. Joi
 n us for a night dedicated to perreo\, sapphic power\, and community. 💋
 🌶️♥️ Expect a true perreo experience. Our incredible DJs will be 
 spinning old-school reggaetón\, new perreo anthems\, and Latin pop hits. 
 We’ve taken your feedback to heart\, so get ready for more reggaetón vi
 ejito and more full tracks all night long. 🎶🔥 DJ Yamari is gonna be 
 playing the best reguetón songs!😍 And now announcing: Princess Papi wi
 th a burlesque act 😘 Dress code: Perreo approved\, but come as you are 
 ❤️❤️❤️❤️ 📅 Saturday\, May 2nd 📍 268 Augusta Ave\, Su
 permarket Bar and Variety ⏰ 10:30 PM – 2:30 AM 🎟️ Limited presale
  – $15 ($20 at the door\, if available) PLEASE READ BEFORE PURCHASING: L
 as Malinches is an intentionally curated space for sapphics including lesb
 ian\, bisexual\, and pansexual women (cis &amp\; trans)\, trans men\, non-
 binary and 2-spirit individuals who identify as sapphic. We celebrate that
  sapphics present in a myriad of ways &amp\; can’t wait to see you all o
 n the dancefloor.💋🔥 This event is not open to cis men. We are a priv
 ate gathering centered on safety\, comfort\, and celebration within our co
 mmunity ♥️ This is a 19+ event. A valid physical government-issued ID 
 is required for entry. Photography and video will be captured throughout t
 he night 📸🎥 By attending\, you acknowledge that media may be taken. 
 If you prefer not to appear in photos or videos\, please avoid interacting
  with event photographers. If you require any accommodations\, please cont
 act the organizer via Instagram before the event\, we’ll do our best to 
 support you 💫 ‍
