BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Black Queer Open Mic Night
DTSTART:20260503T183000
DTEND:20260503T183000
UID:61e82627a8850e65963f4f54c2a8f75f@yohomo.ca
DESCRIPTION:UNTOLD Stories is an intimate\, living room style open mic cre
 ated by and for Black members of the queer and trans community. This is a 
 closed event for black community members. It is a space to share\, witness
 \, and listen to each others stories within a community that sees us and w
 ants to listen. Our next open mic will be held on Sunday\, May 3rd\, 2026 
 at 6:30 PM and Bampot Tea House (201 Harbord St\, Toronto\, ON M5S 1H6). @
 bampothouse Use the link in bio on instagram to sign up to share your stor
 ies! There will also be some spots open for signing up on the night of the
  event! Bring any medium or form of expression. We welcome all forms of ar
 t and whether you’re new to sharing or well seasoned with sharing your a
 rtistic expressions! There will be some instruments there that you can use
  (guitar\, djembe\, ukulele\, and some smaller instruments). You’re welc
 ome to share: Personal or family stories Poetry or prose Fiction or non-fi
 ction storytelling Song or instrumental pieces Visual art (and speaking ab
 out it) Journal entries Improv or performance art Drag or Burlesque Comedy
  set Or anything else that feels true to you ✨💗 Schedule 6:30 PM: Doo
 rs &amp\; performer “night-of” sign-up open 7:00 PM: Performances begi
 n 9:30 PM: DJ set by @Nsaa_spins and mingle 10:00 PM: Event closes You are
  welcome to come to share or simply to listen. We are excited to see you 
 🌺🌸🍓💖 This event is free or by donation. You are welcome to don
 ate any amount\, and any donations go towards future events. Cash at the d
 oor or e-transfer blackuntoldstories@gmail.com. #blackqueer #openmic #toro
 ntoevents #blacktrans ‍
LOCATION:Bampot\, 201 Harbord St
URL:https://www.yohomo.ca/event/black-queer-open-mic-night
X-SOURCE:YOHOMO
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Tell Me I&#x27\;m a Good Girl Play Party
DTSTART:20260503T190000
DTEND:20260503T190000
UID:123fb56484263531849f47edcc34f24c@yohomo.ca
DESCRIPTION:Join us at Birdhaus for the Tell Me I&#x27\;m a Good Girl Fund
 raising Play Party! Help us make a short film set in the Toronto K!nk scen
 e. Dust off your Sunday best and wear your k!nk and f3tish finest to the p
 lay party of the season Join us for a fundraising party at Birdhaus for th
 e project\, “Tell Me I’m a Good Girl\,” a 15‑minute short film tha
 t serves as a proof‑of‑concept for a series exploring k!nk\, neurodive
 rgence and self-discovery with depth\, honesty\, and a funny\, fresh persp
 ective. The project is going to camera this year\, we have a complete prod
 uction team\, director\, writer and cast. Now we just need that final push
  to get us past the finish line and to a place where we can pay our team a
 s much as we can for their work. Support Toronto k!nk artists and this mag
 ical project showcasing some of Toronto&#x27\;s best kink artists\, expert
 s\, folks and spaces. Join us for an evening of: Cocktail Socializing K!nk
 y Night Market Raffle Prizes Tiered Tickets w/Add Ons Silent Auction Photo
 shoot Area Play Party Monitored Dungeon Plounge Logline Raffi is a 28 year
 -old people-pleaser who follows whatever her mother\, religious community\
 , boyfriend and her personified inner voices want her to be (ala Inside Ou
 t)\, but when a reconnection with an old friend leads her into the salacio
 us world of sapphic BDSM\, she discovers an unlikely home where she can be
  the bad girl she always wanted to be. Interested in becoming an investor?
  Want your name in the credits? Contact us and our producer will be in tou
 ch. Photo Credit to Aurielle (IG: @aurii_elle) at Garden of Earthly Deligh
 ts ‍
LOCATION:Birdhaus\, 1233 Queen Street West Rear ( the big pink building!)
URL:https://www.yohomo.ca/event/tell-me-im-a-good-girl-play-party
X-SOURCE:YOHOMO
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:SUPERSEXE - STAR WARS!
DTSTART:20260503T210000
DTEND:20260503T210000
UID:058074a04619d1a0d203c600d2b1fb56@yohomo.ca
DESCRIPTION:The force calls upon the Jedi of Supersexe to (dance) battle t
 he evil bass of the dark side May 3rd! Come indulge in the one-of-a-kind s
 illiness\, and deliciously Pure Campy fashion at the 26th installment of S
 tella Maise&#x27\;s solo collective show\; SUPERSEXE. Doors open at 9:00pm
  \; doors close at 1:30am $20 at the door 9pm-1am\, $5 after 1am! Events e
 nds at 2:30am. SUPERSEXE LINEUP Stella Maise (@estellamaise on IG) &lt\;--
  Birthday Gal!! Will play whatever they want bc it&#x27\;s their birthdayy
 yy :3 WITH SPECIAL GUEST DJs GUSSXEON (@gussyee b2b @xeonaeons) on IG) MMX
 XI (@mmxximusic) on IG) Location: SeeScape\, 347 Keele St. T.O (This venue
  is unfortunately inaccessible\, no entry ramp available\, and this show w
 ill be taking place in the upstairs area which is only accessible by stair
 s. Apologies for any limitations caused\; we look forward to our future ev
 ents that are within fully accessible venues!) Theme: Star Wars (whether y
 ou&#x27\;re on the dark side or light\, or an alien- may your fits be out-
 of-this-world!) Music Vibe: Music vibes will be Dubstep\, DnB\, Hardcore\,
  Trap\, Jungle\, Riddim\, Techno\, Bass and beyond. An eclectic compilatio
 n of delicious cult hits and deep cuts. Important: This is not an adult pl
 ay/kink/s3x party. Supersexe is an event for queer/trans/femme presenting 
 people. If you do not fall under this bracket\, you must be accompanied by
  someone who does. NO REFUNDS Behind SUPERSEXE: A queer-led event\, spotli
 ghting alternative artists and performers. SUPERSEXE is named after the no
 w-closed Montreal-based strip club\, Super Sexe\, that unfortunately burnt
  down in 2021. I (Stella) had always wanted to go since I was a kid. The g
 litzy exterior\, the beautiful femme style\, the extravagance. I wanted to
  encapsulate the image in my head of what could&#x27\;ve been through this
  series (yes\, series!) of SUPERSEXE. ‍
LOCATION:See-Scape\, 347 Keele St
URL:https://www.yohomo.ca/event/supersexe---star-wars
X-SOURCE:YOHOMO
END:VEVENT
