DESCRIPTION:Calling all pop culture historians! Were you there for the Bri
 tney-Madonna kiss? Can&#x27\;t shut up about how you miss Vine? Miss when 
 Girls and Broadcity were on the air? Here&#x27\;s your chance to prove you
 r expertise on iconic moments like nipple gate\, Justin Bieber&#x27\;s ris
 e from Youtube to the Grammys\, and other significant moments that defined
  the 2000s and 2010s. Join the &quot\;Sue Me&quot\; team and comedian Mich
 elle Forrester for a night of 2000s/2010s trivia! Michelle is a Canadian w
 riter and standup comic who has performed all over the country and was als
 o named a New Face of Comedy by Just for Laughs in 2023. We&#x27\;ll have 
 some awesome prizes\, including copies of &quot\;Julie Chan is Dead&quot\;
 \, which was recently in the Canada Reads long list\, from best selling an
 d award winning author Liann Zhang\; as well as a $50 Three Dollar Bill gi
 ft card\; and more! Your ticket includes a drink ticket (beer/cider/mixed 
 drinks) and there will be a special themed cocktail/mocktail for the event
 ! You won&#x27\;t want to miss it. ‍
