BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Queer Craft Night
DTSTART:20260507T190000
DTEND:20260507T190000
UID:3917b6d0c9632bc90f017e6454d009ef@yohomo.ca
DESCRIPTION:May’s Theme is: Habitat Dioramas! Do you remember the pure j
 oy that came with your teacher announcing that your project was going to b
 e a diorama?! We sure do! Participants will each be given a box to build t
 heir diorama in (or feel free to bring your own). With access to our craft
 ing materials\, you will have the freedom to make whatever you wish! Which
  habitat will you make? A wetland? Your bedroom? Under the sea? It’s up 
 to you! Join us for a night of crafts\, community\, and fun! Queer Craft N
 ight is a relaxed event with revolving themes and materials. The price for
