BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:KONDUKTOR_V11: GRRL [NC]
DTSTART:20260508T220000
DTEND:20260508T220000
UID:59a74d54bc662a028bdeb9141154c21a@yohomo.ca
DESCRIPTION:KONDUKTOR returns for its 11th edition\, bringing another chap
 ter of forward-thinking club music to Toronto. Rooted in electro but never
  defined by it\, the project keeps growing\, shaped by a community that sh
 ows up and keeps coming back. For this edition\, KONDUKTOR welcomes GRRL. 
 North Carolina&#x27\;s GRRL is a DJ and producer with a monthly residency 
 on NTS since 2015 and a discography that pulls the best from electro\, tec
 hno\, jungle\, jersey club\, grime\, and breaks. Writing\, producing\, and
  mixing everything themselves\, their tracks are built around dense percus
 sion\, glitchy vocal chops\, and heavy club energy that is designed for a 
 powerful system inside a dark sweaty room. This March\, GRRL released &quo
 t\;Beetle&quot\; a 24-track record that runs through ballroom\, braindance
 \, hyperpop\, and hard-edged techno without losing focus. Give it a proper
  listen\, and expect the same range in the set. Joining us for the first t
 ime: SHAINGEL\, who is a regular in Toronto’s queer spaces\, bringing ba
 ss-heavy and genre-fluid sets to the dance floor\, including global club s
 ound across ghettotech\, gqom\, bailefunk and more. Support from residents
  /ASYNC and HYCASTLE going b2b for the first time\, fusing freaky bass wit
 h deep technicality\; closing set from XELA with some distorted analogue i
 nfluenced breaks. 22:00-03:00 May 8th\, 2026 Cafeteria 1650 Dupont St\, To
 ronto Early bird tickets sold out immediately. Second tier at $21 almost s
 old out\, next tier is $25. SECURE YOUR SPOT NOW! KONDUKTOR has zero toler
 ance for harassment of any kind. Your freedom on the floor is everything. 
 Respect yourself and others\, look out for the people around you. If someo
 ne makes you feel unsafe\, find a member of our KREW. We’ll handle it im
 mediately. SEE U S00N &lt\;3 ‍
LOCATION:Cafeteria\, 1650 Dupont Street
URL:https://www.yohomo.ca/event/konduktor-v11-grrl-nc
X-SOURCE:YOHOMO
END:VEVENT
