BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Soul Cleanse
DTSTART:20260508T220000
DTEND:20260508T220000
UID:1c351f9799aa19d2ed29c4fbb4e8f46b@yohomo.ca
DESCRIPTION:Your favourite genre-bending party is back! After a one year h
 iatus\, Tdesu &amp\; Sudaneeya are joining forces once again to curate an 
 electrifying sonic experience for all the music lovers hosted by Stms. We
 ’re bringing out some of our favourite selectas to provide a variety of 
 sounds from around the globe that will cleanse your soul. Join us at Bar 
 Đêm on May 8th for a night of global edits\, afrobeats + amapiano\, r&am
 p\;b\, baile funk\, future beats + everything in between. Come as you are\
 , trust the DJs &amp\; let the music heal you! 308 Dundas St W\, Toronto\,
  ON — Located behind Dzo Viet Eatery\, entry via McCaul street. About ou
 r line up: Sudaneeya Iman/Sudaneeya is a diasporic Sudanese multidisciplin
 ary creative &amp\; curator currently based in Toronto. Born in Cairo\, Eg
 ypt and raised throughout the middle east\, Sudaneeya is inspired by the c
 ultures that helped shape her identity as an artist. As a creatively incli
 ned individual\, she discovered her love for DJing &amp\; music curation d
 uring her time co-hosting a podcast titled ‘boarding diaspora’. With t
 he help of creative mentors &amp\; friends\, she mastered the craft and is
  now establishing herself in Toronto’s music scene. Her focus is to crea
 te spaces that celebrate racialized DJs. Tdesu is known for his genre-defy
 ing remixes\, blending global and dance rhythms with soulful sounds. At 1 
 million+ streams and features on platforms such as Boiler Room\, Soulectio
 n\, Rinse FM\, and Elevator music\, he is steadily rising as one of the mo
 st exciting emerging producers from SoundCloud. Through 9 years djing &amp
 \; 12 years producing music\, he has performed across the US\, CDMX\, Cost
 a Rica\, and Canada. Always reading the room\, his sets seamlessly blend e
 lements of electronic\, R&amp\;B\, hip hop\, jazz\, soul and more into an 
 unforgettable sonic experience. JamJam Bringing a blend of r&amp\;b\, glob
 al sounds\, edits and more with buttery transitions - curated to move your
  body with a little bounce and a little soul Stms Stms (pronounced “Stem
 s”) is a platform showcasing DJs\, music producers\, &amp\; remix cultur
 e through events in Toronto. Launched in 2023 by organizer Tdesu\, Stms ha
 s hosted over 20 events featuring some of Canada’s top sound selectors a
 nd international guests from New York\, Antwerp\, Melbourne\, and more. Ba
 r Đêm A hidden intimate Viet-inspired speakeasy bar in the heart of down
 town Toronto across from the AGO. Its discreet entrance and top-tier mixol
 ogy make it one of Toronto’s most sought-after destinations for those in
  the know. ‍
LOCATION:Bar Dem\, 308 Dundas St W
URL:https://www.yohomo.ca/event/soul-cleanse
X-SOURCE:YOHOMO
END:VEVENT
