DESCRIPTION:WE&#x27\;RE BACK! CROSSOVER is back for a brand new season of 
 partying for the girls\, gays &amp\; allies!!! Join us Saturday May 9th at
  Midnight Arcade in Kensington Market for Season 2 Episode 1. From 10pm-la
 te we&#x27\;ll have drink specials\, DJs and free arcade games all night l
 ong. SOUNDS BY: PLAYGIRL COHEN JORDIOR JAMIE-LEE HOSTED BY: AKIL Crossover
  is a queer and BIPOC-led collective dedicated to bringing people of all i
 dentities and gender expressions together through music\, dance\, and comm
 unity. It offers an inclusive space to move\, connect\, and takes you on a
  journey through sound from dancehall and baile funk to hip hop\, future b
 eats\, jersey club\, house &amp\; more. Our goal is simple: to keep you mo
 ving and connected from start to finish. We spotlight both emerging and es
 tablished DJs\, inviting them beyond their usual contexts into a shared sp
 ace that blend the sounds we know and love with ones you’re just discove
 ring. ‍
LOCATION:Midnight Arcade\, 158 Augusta Ave
URL:https://www.yohomo.ca/event/crossover-season-2-episode-1
