BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Mousse T. Toronto Long Weekend
DTSTART:20260515T220000
DTEND:20260515T220000
UID:940135a985727ad56e4f3ca08649d9e3@yohomo.ca
DESCRIPTION:Mousse T. + Friends May 15th (holiday weekend) Downtown Toront
 o 10pm to 5am With a career spanning over three decades\, Mousse T. stands
  as one of house music’s most influential and enduring figures. From his
  early days shaping funk infused\, synth driven sounds to becoming a globa
 l force behind timeless records like Horny and Sex Bomb\, his catalogue br
 idges mainstream success and deep underground credibility with rare ease. 
 As the founder of Peppermint Jam Records\, he helped define a signature so
 und rooted in soulful house\, disco\, influencing generations of producers
  and dancers alike. Today\, as a key artist on the Glitterbox roster\, he 
 continues to deliver sets that are nostalgic\, uplifting\, and built for t
 he dance floor. On May 15\, Toronto welcomes a true master of the craft. T
 his is not just another booking\, it is a rare opportunity to experience o
 ne of the architects of modern house music in an intimate\, high energy se
 tting. Expect a night built on groove\, soul\, and connection\, where clas
 sic influences meet forward thinking selections\, and the dance floor beco
 mes a shared moment of release. From the first record to the final track\,
  this will be a journey. A celebration of house music at its finest. A nig
 ht for those who understand. A portion of proceeds from this event will su
 pport VIBE Arts\, a Toronto based organization dedicated to increasing acc
 ess to the arts for youth and underserved communities. Through free progra
 ms\, workshops\, and mentorship\, VIBE Arts empowers the next generation o
 f creatives and helps build stronger\, more inclusive communities through 
 artistic expression. ‍
LOCATION:Sound Machine\, 178 Bathurst St
URL:https://www.yohomo.ca/event/mousse-t-toronto-long-weekend
X-SOURCE:YOHOMO
END:VEVENT
