DESCRIPTION:DE Productions Presents: PRIDE UNHINGED Toronto\, get ready—
 this Pride Weekend\, we’re turning the volume all the way up. 🔥 On Ju
 ne 27\, 2026\, step into a night of pure chaos\, energy\, and unapologetic
  queer joy at PRIDE UNHINGED—the party where anything goes and everythin
 g slays. Headlining the night is the unstoppable Tara Dikhof—DJ\, produc
 er\, and full-time party girl known for igniting dancefloors across the gl
 obe. Having opened for icons like Chappell Roan\, Aliyah’s Interlude\, C
 hrissy Chlapecka\, and Violet Chachki\, Tara brings a genre-fluid sound th
 at blends pop\, electronic\, and underground beats into one euphoric exper
 ience. When Tara is behind the decks\, expect nothing less than a full-blo
 wn rager. Joining her is DJ Mar\, delivering nonstop vibes to keep you mov
 ing all night long\, plus electrifying pop-up drag performances by Xtacy L
 ove and Heaven Lee Hytes. And when you think the night can’t get any hot
 ter\, Go-Go dancer Kat hits the stage to keep the energy sky-high. 📍 Lo
 dge on Queen – 251 Queen St. W 🕘 Doors open at 9PM 🎟️ Tickets: $
 30 advance / $35 at the door (available exclusively on ShowPass) Whether y
 ou’re here to dance\, celebrate\, or lose yourself in the music\, PRIDE 
 UNHINGED is your destination for an unforgettable Pride Saturday. Bring yo
 ur friends\, bring your energy\, and get ready to sweat\, sparkle\, and go
  completely UNHINGED. This isn’t just a party—it’s a RAGER. 🌈 ‍
LOCATION:Lodge on Queen\, 251 Queen Street W
URL:https://www.yohomo.ca/event/pride-unhinged
